  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Fabric 鐵製儲物箱模組</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fabric 鐵製儲物箱是一個簡單的模組，透過新增可升級的儲物箱來增強您的 Minecraft 遊戲體驗，讓您能在單一方塊中儲存更多物品。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每個儲物箱皆可升級，從木製儲物箱（原版 Minecraft）開始。您只需製作一個儲物箱升級工具，然後按住 Shift 鍵並右鍵點擊想要升級的儲物箱即可。這樣就不需要破壞已放置的儲物箱。請放心，儲物箱內的物品將會保留。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0FJGgga.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"559\"></span></p><h3>現已新增水晶儲物箱</h3><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/675/2021-07-28_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"605\"></p><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎您透過 GitHub 的「Issue」區塊提出任何改進建議，或使用「Pull Request」區塊提交程式碼優化，共同參與模組開發。您也可以透過後者提交模組的翻譯（或更新現有翻譯）。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>模組需求</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://images2.imgbox.com/8e/38/bfInI5qv_o.png\" width=\"149\" height=\"50\"></strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>儲物箱升級：<br></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">聖誕節：27 格</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">銅製：45 格</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鐵製：54 格</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">金製：81 格</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">綠寶石：108 格</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鑽石：108 格</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">水晶：108 格</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">黑曜石：108 格</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>儲物箱</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>銅製儲物箱</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/677/310/172/copper.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"139\"><br>鐵製儲物箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/678/310/172/iron.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"137\"><br>金製儲物箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/679/310/172/gold.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"138\"><br>鑽石儲物箱<br><br>黑曜石儲物箱<br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/680/310/172/obisidina.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"137\"></strong></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>升級工具</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>木製升級至銅製<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/683/310/172/wood-copper.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"138\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br>銅製升級至鐵製<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/685/310/172/copper-iron.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"137\"><br>鐵製升級至金製<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/686/310/172/iron-gold.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"136\"><br>金製升級至鑽石<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/687/310/172/gold-diamond.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"140\"><br>鑽石升級至黑曜石<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/688/310/172/diamond-obsidian.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"137\"><br></strong></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>已知錯誤</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前暫無已知錯誤。若您發現任何問題，請至 GitHub 回報，說明遇到的情況、重現步驟，並附上崩潰記錄或其他相關證據。&nbsp;</span></p>",
